    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、9:16竖屏的真人古风建筑漫剧短片，漫剧真人影像\" (Generate a 15-second, 9:16 vertical format, real person ancient architecture animation short film).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The frames depict a man in traditional Chinese clothing (gray/green robe) in what appears to be an ancient Chinese courtyard setting.\n- The lighting is atmospheric with lanterns providing warm illumination.\n- The architectural details are well-rendered with traditional Chinese rooflines, wooden pillars, stone work, and tiled floors.\n- The overall image quality is high with good clarity and detail.\n- The cinematography shows smooth transitions between shots, with consistent lighting and color grading.\n- There are no obvious visual artifacts or distortions; the rendering is clean and professional.\n- The depth of field and focus management contribute to a cinematic feel.\n- Overall Visual Quality aligns with a top-tier production level.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The prompt requests a 15-second, 9:16 vertical format, real person, ancient architecture, animation short film.\n- The video presents a real person in authentic attire within a historically styled courtyard, with clear architectural cues and a cohesive mood.\n- The framing and pacing are consistent with a short-form narrative, and the visuals support the intended concept.\n- The alignment is strong overall, capturing the essential elements of the prompt. Minor deviations may exist but do not undermine the core alignment.\n\nPhysical Consistency / Common-sense:\n- The scene maintains coherent physical behavior: natural human movement, plausible interactions with the environment, and consistent lighting/shadow dynamics.\n- Architectural proportions and spatial relationships appear believable, with no obvious physics violations.\n- Some very minor inconsistencies could be present in distant background details or micro-motions, but they do not disrupt the overall realism.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- Visual Quality: 5/5\n- Text-to-Video Alignment: 4/5\n- Physical Consistency: 4/5\n\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 5\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
